        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "PROBLEM 3A-5RESPONSE OF A SINGLE-DEGREE-OF-FREEDOM SYSTEM SUBJECT TO DYNAMIC LOAD ",
            "block_bbox": [
                156,
                266,
                1027,
                328
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Problem:Determine the maximum response and the corresponding time it occurs of a single-degree-of-freedom system subjected to dynamic load using (a) numerical methods and (b) design charts.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                366,
                1024,
                444
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Procedure: Part (a) - Numerical Methods ",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                465,
                597,
                486
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 1.Establish dimensional parameters of the system.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                509,
                782,
                531
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 2.Determine the natural period of vibration and integration time interval.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                553,
                994,
                576
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 3.Construct a table similar to Table 3-14 (+) of Section 3-19.2.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                597,
                899,
                620
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Note:For the first interval $n=1$ ,Equation 3-59 is used and subsequent intervals,the recurrence formula (Equation 3-56) is used.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                641,
                1034,
                691
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Procedure: Part (b) - Chart solution ",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                713,
                541,
                734
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 1.Same as Step 1 of Example 3A-5, Part (a).",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                757,
                723,
                781
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 2.Determine the non-dimensional parameters.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                802,
                734,
                824
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 3.Determine the ratio of the maximum displacement to the elastic displacement $X_{m}/X_{E}$ and the ratio of the time at which this maximum displacement occurs to the duration of the blast load.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                845,
                983,
                921
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
